        "created_at": "2021-09-24T02:59:54.479Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/782b6557e9bec8e26b5a7fdd46aa499d1fe0f977.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/782b6557e9bec8e26b5a7fdd46aa499d1fe0f977\" title=\"20210923215141_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/782b6557e9bec8e26b5a7fdd46aa499d1fe0f977_2_690x431.jpeg\" alt=\"20210923215141_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"h94gQlvzKRfPNvWteZ4adVpEvav\" width=\"690\" height=\"431\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/782b6557e9bec8e26b5a7fdd46aa499d1fe0f977_2_690x431.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/782b6557e9bec8e26b5a7fdd46aa499d1fe0f977_2_1035x646.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/782b6557e9bec8e26b5a7fdd46aa499d1fe0f977_2_1380x862.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/782b6557e9bec8e26b5a7fdd46aa499d1fe0f977_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20210923215141_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1680×1050 495 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Boards have been pretty quiet this week. Finally got around to completing this. As you can see, classic Blade in Insula Primalis vs. F6 Bunker, Fanatic, F5 Wraith, F6 Tempest, and F5 Legacy.</p>\n<p>Not much to say about it. Finished at the beginning of Tempest’s 3rd turn, with everyone still in double digits. I guess the challenge is who was able to end it earlier?</p>",
