        "username": "The_Justifier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-09-24T18:06:39.204Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well I don’t remember what round it was, but I am sure I never once felt even the slightest sense of danger.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d5199165cde4370aad9b84bac88100c74b1a8d90.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/d5199165cde4370aad9b84bac88100c74b1a8d90\" title=\"Screenshot_20210920-195553\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d5199165cde4370aad9b84bac88100c74b1a8d90_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20210920-195553\" data-base62-sha1=\"upatMivq8mECdal7RBY24WtLCZq\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d5199165cde4370aad9b84bac88100c74b1a8d90_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d5199165cde4370aad9b84bac88100c74b1a8d90_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d5199165cde4370aad9b84bac88100c74b1a8d90_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d5199165cde4370aad9b84bac88100c74b1a8d90_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20210920-195553</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 106 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>For comparison, Baron Blade did manage to beat these heroes a couple days later, so I’m not sure what made the difference, other than Legacy.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7ca051bbbf2b87e6ba5eb19d8e5f4c94b78ab2ec.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/7ca051bbbf2b87e6ba5eb19d8e5f4c94b78ab2ec\" title=\"Screenshot_20210923-100631\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7ca051bbbf2b87e6ba5eb19d8e5f4c94b78ab2ec_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20210923-100631\" data-base62-sha1=\"hMuGHHSTrgvLcVs6k8bqEZcGGHa\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7ca051bbbf2b87e6ba5eb19d8e5f4c94b78ab2ec_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7ca051bbbf2b87e6ba5eb19d8e5f4c94b78ab2ec_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7ca051bbbf2b87e6ba5eb19d8e5f4c94b78ab2ec_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7ca051bbbf2b87e6ba5eb19d8e5f4c94b78ab2ec_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20210923-100631</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 99.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Either way, I figured this week was a wind-down from <span class=\"hashtag\">#300</span>.  Hopefully the next one will provide a bit of a challenge again.  (But not <em>too</em> much of one, as my efforts to catch up with recent weeklies have been stymied a bit by WAY too many of them being at Ultimate.)</p>",
